  "authority": {
    "confirmed": [
      "Pirate rolls rank from King Pirate down to Crew, grants 0..2 total numeric stat points according to rank, then rolls a ship.",
      "Ships use real historical legendary pirate-associated vessels; no fictional franchise ships.",
      "Existing user equal-default rule applies when no probability ratio is specified.",
      "User confirms Pirate ship adds no gameplay effect: cosmetic design, visual and narrative context only. Rank stat bonuses remain unchanged."
    ],
    "authoredChoices": "Six game rank options and exact stat allocation are proposed within user delegation, not a claim of universal historical hierarchy. King Pirate Fight +2; Captain Fight +1/Intelligence +1; Quartermaster Intelligence +1; First Mate Fight +1; Boatswain Strength +1; Crew none. Eighteen curated historical ships; roster is adjustable and not an exhaustive inventory of all pirate ships."
