  "contracts": {
    "order": "Actual Pirate result/reaction -> one equal rank spin -> selected 0..2-point stat recipe/reaction -> one equal cosmetic ship spin -> presentation context/reaction -> Backstory.",
    "probability": "Six equal ranks (1/6), eighteen equal ships (1/18) under the user default; no category, success, quantity, rank-dependent ship rarity or historic-fame modifier.",
    "rankReward": "Each rank grants exactly its frozen recipe total 0..2 numeric points, not that amount on every stat. Apply per-stat flat modifiers once after immutable raw bases; Crew zero/no reroll. Fixed reward is not a Lucky Number stat spin.",
    "identity": "Ships are real historically attested associations, with notes for privateering/history uncertainties. Alias names for one ship share one outcome; genuinely different ships sharing a name retain separate IDs. Historical captain is reference context, not owner Race/hero/mentor/event or an ally grant.",
    "ship": "Store only the actual selected ship identity/alias/history source as presentation.pirateShip. Ship affects visual design/narration only: no stats, power, weapon, vehicle, mastery, Enchant, crew/army, Size, command/control, hidden event or later odds modifier. Rank bonus remains unchanged.",
    "ledger": "Freeze both wheel pools/odds, rule version, selected rank recipe and cosmetic ship identity/aliases/source refs. Rank package is source-keyed to its actual rank spin; presentation record to its actual ship spin. Commit each once; replay adds no spin, stat bonus, inventory entity or second presentation record.",
    "reaction": "Stack actual rank/declared bonus then cosmetic ship/history association in order. Ship may appear in image/video context without implied ownership/control or gameplay grants. No future Backstory/stat/mastery result inferred; captions do not create funny tags.",
    "return": "After two actual child spins and reactions restore Backstory; preserve Race rewards/normal Weapon and Power stages."
  },
